{"about_the_game":"<strong>A simple screen with a railroad crossing (alarm and barrier) and tracks lined up.<br>Click the mouse or a button on the controller to lower the barrier and see lots of trains coming through!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 types of crossings (alarms and barriers)!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795140/extras/86518e1d16945b6618e0185f5212fa99.avif?t=1753027317\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 types of trains!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795140/extras/6b3c24c29a188baade5fbcbdf76e3fb2.avif?t=1753027317\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3 types of backgrounds!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795140/extras/422c9f02dec562784fa7c7b0225397c9.avif?t=1753027317\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can place hiragana, numbers, and alphabets on the passenger cars!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795140/extras/fcdbc47b49258fa39061d784091586b0.avif?t=1753027317\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfThere are two types of control: &quot;buttons&quot; and &quot;mouse.&quot;</h2>With &quot;buttons,&quot; click the &quot;crossing barrier,&quot; &quot;conventional line,&quot; &quot;bullet train,&quot; and &quot;steam locomotive&quot; buttons at the bottom of the screen (if using a controller, use the directional pad and A, X, and Y buttons).<br><br>With &quot;mouse,&quot; click on the screen with the mouse and the barrier will come down and the train selected (in the settings) will come running.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795140?t=175302